      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Dudley Priory, a Cluniac house founded around 1160 by Gervase de Paganel, once controlled several local churches.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dudley",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s industrial past includes the Bean Cars factory, opened early 20th century, still standing for other uses.",
